<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36852" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pollen</span></b> , ĭnis,
		n., and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pollis</span></b> ,
			ĭnis, m. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>f</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάλη</span>]. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>fine flour</i>, <i>milldust</i>, <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R.
				156</span></i>; <i><span class="en">157</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 13,
				12, 26, § 82</span></i>; <i><span class="en">18, 9, 20, §
			87</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ter. Ad. 5, 3,
			60</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>fine dust</i> of
			other things: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">piperis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 4,
					4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					6, 30, 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 29, 3, 11, § 39</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquid in pollinem tundere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					19, 5, 29, § 91</span></i>
			. 
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
